WEBVTT

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:30.504
Biti kvir in trans pomeni ustvarjati
nove valove obstoja.

00:03:30.914 --> 00:03:32.697
Pomeni ljubiti ljudi, take kot so,

00:03:32.721 --> 00:03:34.573
ne kot bi morali biti.

00:03:34.597 --> 00:03:36.574
Kim se ne opravičuje za svojo ženstvenost

00:03:36.598 --> 00:03:39.416
v svetu, ki je pogosto krut in nasilen

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.723
do žensk, ki so preveč
ponosne in osvobojene.

00:03:41.747 --> 00:03:43.368
In jaz nisem šel v to zvezo

00:03:43.392 --> 00:03:46.897
zato, da bila ona
moja pomočnica ali moje rebro,

00:03:46.921 --> 00:03:48.663
ampak kompleksna -

00:03:48.687 --> 00:03:49.702
(Smeh)

00:03:49.726 --> 00:03:51.390
KKM: Kajne? To ni prav.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.486
TM: Ampak kompleksen človek,

00:03:53.486 --> 00:03:57.385
katerega ženstvenost ni tu, da jo
prevladam, nadzorujem ali kritiziram.

00:03:57.397 --> 00:03:58.919
To je njena briljantnost,

00:03:58.943 --> 00:04:00.587
kako vodi s sočutjem